  "cash_definition": "Cash = par stablecoins (USDS, USDC, USDT, DAI and their chain variants) sitting in the cluster wallets below on every chain, including USDS held raw in the L2 ALM wallets (the settlement repo's 'USDS raw (chain - POL)' rows), plus the idle balance inside each Savings V2 vault contract. Nothing inside a position, pool or vault strategy (sUSDS on any chain is an allocation). PYUSD, RLUSD, USDG and sUSDS in the ALM Proxy are allocations, not cash. SPK, MORPHO and other tokens are non-stable assets, not cash. Nothing is netted: Sky direct exposure sits in pools, never in wallets.",
